un teykef in a vokh iz nisht geven keyn broyt. s'iz nisht geven vos tsu esn. s'iz, s'iz gevorn a iberkerenish.

201
00:11:27,567 --> 00:11:29,217
un

202
00:11:29,217 --> 00:11:31,554
un mayn tate iz gekumen

203
00:11:31,554 --> 00:11:34,347
⟨epes⟩ tsurik mit ts- nokh tsvey vokhn

204
00:11:34,347 --> 00:11:36,195
iz er tsu fus gekumen

205
00:11:36,195 --> 00:11:40,776
un hot gezogt az m'hot im gut geshlogn oyf di gas, az m'hot tsugenumen bay im dos ferd

206
00:11:40,776 --> 00:11:43,490
mit der britshke vos er iz geforn fun dem feld

207
00:11:43,868 --> 00:11:45,645
un

208
00:11:45,645 --> 00:11:46,916
un m'hot im geshlogn.

209
00:11:47,952 --> 00:11:52,007
ven er iz gekumen aheym, hot er, hot men genumen mentshn

210
00:11:52,007 --> 00:11:56,082
mit di dokumentn, ver zey zenen un vu zey zenen

211
00:11:56,082 --> 00:12:00,467
un er iz gegangen arbetn, azoy vi ikh hob shoyn gezogt, in RAYPOTREBSOYUZ

212
00:12:00,878 --> 00:12:05,448
als, ikh veys nisht vos er hot gearbet. ikh veys az m'hot im geshikt fun danet aher, aher ahin

213
00:12:05,448 --> 00:12:08,249
un der pakhed iz geven in shtub

214
00:12:08,249 --> 00:12:10,760
erger vi, vi, vi, vi der toyt.

215
00:12:11,779 --> 00:12:13,033
ir hot gehat

216
00:12:13,033 --> 00:12:14,911
fraynt?

217
00:12:15,730 --> 00:12:17,611
in Khotin?

218
00:12:16,130 --> 00:12:17,527
akhuts, yo.

219
00:12:17,652 --> 00:12:21,890
fraynt un mames mishpokhe, un der tate's

220
00:12:17,673 --> 00:12:20,223
akhuts di mame's mishpokhe.

221
00:12:20,930 --> 00:12:23,889
hot ir gekent makhn fraynt dort in di tsayt?

222
00:12:24,064 --> 00:12:28,428
yo. geyen eyns tsum andern hot men gekent. s'iz nisht geven keyn getos.

223
00:12:28,485 --> 00:12:34,166
bay di rusn iz nisht geven keyn getos. s'iz geven a fintster lebn, a moyre. m'hot moyre gehat.

224
00:12:34,290 --> 00:12:39,194
far vos iz geven di moyre? vayl m'hot genumen mentshn, un m'hot zey geshikt keyn Sib- m'hot nisht gevust vuhin zey shikn

225
00:12:39,538 --> 00:12:41,442
m'hot tseharget FAMILIES

226
00:12:41,442 --> 00:12:44,409
un zey vern farshvundn. di mentshn vern farshvundn.

227
00:12:46,508 --> 00:12:49,354
iz vos hot pasirt in nayntsn tsvey un fertsik?

228
00:12:50,659 --> 00:12:52,593
in eyn un fertsik

229
00:12:52,870 --> 00:12:55,311
iz, hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome

230
00:12:55,907 --> 00:13:00,457
un s'hobn zikh ongehoybn di sheyne yidishe historyes.

231
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:08,321
di rusn zenen teykef avekgegangen.

232
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:11,493
m'hot gelozt di shtot

233
00:13:11,753 --> 00:13:12,793
aleyn.

234
00:13:13,018 --> 00:13:15,678
a vokh tsayt hot men gerabevet.

235
00:13:15,938 --> 00:13:17,417
m'hot geharget.

236
00:13:17,575 --> 00:13:19,647
un m'hot gevaldikt kinder.

237
00:13:19,647 --> 00:13:20,454
meydlekh.

238
00:13:21,203 --> 00:13:22,918
in a vokh arum

239
00:13:23,548 --> 00:13:24,487
a vokh

240
00:13:24,848 --> 00:13:27,542
zenen arayngekumen di daytshn

241
00:13:27,683 --> 00:13:28,942
di rumener

242
00:13:29,050 --> 00:13:33,347
un di politsey vos iz geven biz di rusn zenen arayngekumen.

243
00:13:39,850 --> 00:13:44,096
es hot zikh gerisn di, di bombe, un s- m'hot geshosn fun ile zaytn

244
00:13:44,170 --> 00:13:47,457
zenen mir aropgegangen, aropge- zikh gebahaltn

245
00:13:47,457 --> 00:13:49,465
bay mayn tatn's shvester

246
00:13:49,465 --> 00:13:51,892
zi hot gevoynt nisht vayt fun dem Dnyester.

247
00:13:53,029 --> 00:13:55,976
dortn hobn mir zikh ale gebahaltn in

248
00:13:58,412 --> 00:14:00,819
in kanaves fun

249
00:14:00,876 --> 00:14:02,034
fun leym.

250
00:14:03,492 --> 00:14:07,097
un di eltere shvester hot gehat a, a kind fun a khoydesh.

251
00:14:11,001 --> 00:14:12,530
dos kind hot geveynt.

252
00:14:16,333 --> 00:14:21,258
ven mir hobn zikh gebahaltn fun di, di pulemyotn hobn geshosn, ibergeshosn

253
00:14:21,258 --> 00:14:23,415
fun Khotin biz Zhvanets

254
00:14:23,539 --> 00:14:27,704
antloyfn hot men nisht gekent derfar vos s'iz geven ibergerisn

255
00:14:27,704 --> 00:14:30,452
di brikn zenen geven ibergerisn, un m'hot geshosn.

256
00:14:38,170 --> 00:14:41,370
ven mir hobn zikh umgekert aheym

257
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:45,015
iz geven ales tserabevet

258
00:14:45,510 --> 00:14:47,658
un, un shmutsik

259
00:14:47,658 --> 00:14:49,402
un s'iz gornisht geven.

260
00:14:50,269 --> 00:14:54,161
teykef hot men tsugenumen mayn tatn mit der mamen in

261
00:14:54,437 --> 00:14:59,071
in der gimnazye, hot men zey farshpart di ale eltere mentshn

262
00:14:59,449 --> 00:15:03,217
un ikh mit mayn shvester undz UNK ibergelozt.

263
00:15:03,217 --> 00:15:06,463
iz ⟨vos⟩ heyst di yugnt hot men gelozt vegn arbet

264
00:15:06,807 --> 00:15:09,467
dernokh dem hobn mir zikh dervust az in

265
00:15:10,468 --> 00:15:14,748
az in Khotin bay dem Dnyester hot men geharget

266
00:15:14,907 --> 00:15:16,251
hunderter

267
00:15:16,476 --> 00:15:17,519
kinder

268
00:15:17,519 --> 00:15:20,672
yinglekh, meydlekh, yugntvayz.

269
00:15:26,702 --> 00:15:30,290
teykef iz men gevorn hungerik. iz teykef nisht geven vos tsu esn.

270
00:15:30,381 --> 00:15:33,868
m'hot nisht gehat keyn, keyn zapasn hot men nisht gemakht.

271
00:15:34,195 --> 00:15:37,041
un bay di rusn iz bikhlal nisht geven vos tsu esn.

272
00:15:38,008 --> 00:15:42,102
zent ir geven dort ven zey hobn avekgenumen day- ayer mame un tatn?

273
00:15:41,367 --> 00:15:42,778
OH YES.

274
00:15:43,138 --> 00:15:45,219
es zenen arayngekumen

275
00:15:45,219 --> 00:15:46,929
rumenishe soldatn

276
00:15:47,290 --> 00:15:50,119
un m'hot tsugenumen mayn tatn mit mayn mamen

277
00:15:50,277 --> 00:15:52,830
in der gimnazye, in dem

278
00:15:52,830 --> 00:15:54,590
dort vu s'iz geven di shul

279
00:15:55,288 --> 00:15:57,594
un undz hot men ibergelozt

280
00:15:57,600 --> 00:16:01,542
un m'hot gezogt me zol zikh nisht rirn funem plats.

281
00:16:09,075 --> 00:16:12,545
di ⟨tirn⟩ zenen geven farshpart, farmakht

282
00:16:14,273 --> 00:16:17,155
un m'hot, di gasn zenen geven leydik

283
00:16:17,155 --> 00:16:21,388
un s'iz shoyn geven toyt. az emetser iz aroysgan oyf der gas, hot men geshosn.

284
00:16:24,482 --> 00:16:27,766
ikh gedenk vi s'hobn zikh tsunoyf

285
00:16:27,908 --> 00:16:28,999
I'M SORRY

286
00:16:32,650 --> 00:16:36,004
in a shtub hobn zikh tsunoyfgenumen froyen

287
00:16:36,004 --> 00:16:37,317
mit kinder

288
00:16:37,476 --> 00:16:39,005
un m'iz geven in eynem.

289
00:16:39,906 --> 00:16:42,060
bay nakht hot men zikh

290
00:16:42,690 --> 00:16:43,842
arayngekhapt

291
00:16:43,842 --> 00:16:45,924
di rumenishe soldatn

292
00:16:46,909 --> 00:16:49,923
un m'hot undz ale oysgeshtelt in eyn raye

293
00:16:51,347 --> 00:16:55,661
un m'hot ongehoybn tsu zukhn yidishe meydlekh, un m'hot zey gevaldikt.

294
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:01,196
mayn shvester LIZA

295
00:17:09,336 --> 00:17:11,439
tsvey mol hot men zi gevaldikt.

296
00:17:11,682 --> 00:17:14,021
un mayn mame iz geshtanen gekukt.

297
00:17:14,078 --> 00:17:17,829
m'hot, m'hot geheysn shteyn un kukn. undz kinder zenen mir nokh geven

298
00:17:17,829 --> 00:17:23,403
hot men undz epes far- farshtelt, far- f- fardekt, un m'hot undz geratevet fun derinen.

299
00:17:26,380 --> 00:17:29,057
mayn shvester hot mer keyn kinder nisht gehat.

300
00:17:29,637 --> 00:17:32,601
zi iz geven tserisn un opgehakt.

301
00:17:33,923 --> 00:17:37,763
zi iz keyn mame nisht geven un hot nisht gehat keyn kinder.

302
00:17:37,763 --> 00:17:40,113
mayne kinder zenen geven ire kinder

303
00:17:40,113 --> 00:17:42,883
un di gantse libe hot zi ibergegebn mayne kinder.

304
00:17:47,524 --> 00:17:53,053
oyfn tsveytn tog ven men, ven m'iz oyfgeshtanen, iz mayn mame geven vays.

305
00:17:54,426 --> 00:17:57,019
m'hot zi nisht derkent. zi iz groy gevorn.

306
00:18:07,757 --> 00:18:10,265
m'hot ongehoybn tsu shikn undz oyf arbet.

307
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,037
shlepn oyf arbet

308
00:18:12,347 --> 00:18:14,872
tsu di daytshn, tsu di rumener.

309
00:18:18,857 --> 00:18:20,458
epes in a monat

310
00:18:20,548 --> 00:18:22,162
tsi in tsvey monatn

311
00:18:24,548 --> 00:18:27,242
hot men undz aroysgetribn fun di shtiber

312
00:18:27,872 --> 00:18:33,451
un m'hot undz geshtelt kol- k- kolones, un m'hot undz ongehoybn tsu traybn.

313
00:18:34,302 --> 00:18:36,844
ikh hob gevolt zogn az

314
00:18:37,052 --> 00:18:40,049
ven m'hot aroysgelozt mayn tatn mit der mamen

315
00:18:41,473 --> 00:18:46,043
iz mayn tate geshtanen oyf di KNEES un hot gezogt mayn shvesterl

316
00:18:46,043 --> 00:18:47,525
"tokhter mayne

317
00:18:48,038 --> 00:18:50,580
du bist a korbn fun der milkhome

318
00:18:52,695 --> 00:18:54,123
halt ikh in di hent

319
00:18:54,619 --> 00:18:56,168
bist a yidish kind."

320
00:18:56,168 --> 00:18:58,882
s'iz gekumen groyse tsores oyf undz.

321
00:19:05,256 --> 00:19:10,476
dos iz shoyn geven nokh a tsvey monatn vos, nokh vos m'hot undz geshlept oyf arbet

322
00:19:10,752 --> 00:19:13,766
un vi gevis vert men koytik un hungerik

323
00:19:18,852 --> 00:19:24,642
un m'hot undz gef- -shlept un ges- un getribn un geshlogn. zen-

324
00:19:24,642 --> 00:19:27,952
fun keyn shlogn un hargenen, es kumt nisht keyn frage.

325
00:19:28,217 --> 00:19:30,644
es hobn zikh gevalgert mentshn oyf di gasn

326
00:19:30,644 --> 00:19:33,071
eltere, kranke, kalikes.

327
00:19:34,939 --> 00:19:39,973
mit undz iz shoyn gegangen di shvester vos zi hot gehat a, a kind fun a khoydesh.

328
00:19:41,329 --> 00:19:45,018
fun Khotin hot men undz getribn tsu fus

329
00:19:45,413 --> 00:19:48,759
un mir zenen ongekumen keyn S- Sekuren

330
00:19:48,759 --> 00:19:50,588
vu mir ze'mir geboyrn gevorn.

331
00:19:51,353 --> 00:19:54,317
vifl mentshn zenen gegangen oyf dem moment?

332
00:19:54,930 --> 00:19:56,848
di, in der kolone?

333
00:19:57,192 --> 00:19:59,295
s'iz geven a sakh mentshn.

334
00:19:59,672 --> 00:20:01,741
s'iz nokh geven yidn

335
00:20:02,305 --> 00:20:05,643
vos, vos m'hot zey aroysgetribn fun di shtiber.

336
00:20:05,643 --> 00:20:08,543
Khotin iz geven a gresere shtot fun

337
00:20:08,599 --> 00:20:12,890
fun Sekuren. s'iz geven a groyse shtot, iz geven a sakh yidn.

338
00:20:12,447 --> 00:20:14,432
ir hot gekent epes mitnemen?

339
00:20:15,771 --> 00:20:18,768
efsher hobn mir m- mir ho'mir nisht gehat vos mittsunemen.

340
00:20:19,197 --> 00:20:23,427
vayl mir zenen gekumen funem Dnyester vu mir ho'mir zikh umgekert, vu m'hot geshosn

341
00:20:23,427 --> 00:20:26,207
iz geven, s'iz geven ales tserabevet un tsugenumen.

342
00:20:26,757 --> 00:20:28,840
un, un keyn

343
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:31,796
hot ir gevust vu ir fort, vu ir geyt, un far vos?

344
00:20:29,867 --> 00:20:31,557
OH NO

345
00:20:31,870 --> 00:20:34,361
far vos hobn mir gevust, vayl mir ze'mir yidn.

346
00:20:40,257 --> 00:20:42,968
di zelbe CUZISTN vos zey zenen geven

347
00:20:43,108 --> 00:20:45,599
un di ⟨elbe⟩, di zelbe

348
00:20:45,690 --> 00:20:48,367
antisemitn zenen zikh mekhaye geven.

349
00:20:48,677 --> 00:20:51,388
zey hobn ⟨gehat⟩ a sheyn arbet.

350
00:20:51,478 --> 00:20:56,163
zey hobn gekent gut shlogn un hargenen yidn., dos iz geven a fargenign far zey.

351
00:20:56,541 --> 00:20:59,420
m'hot undz getribn tog un nakht

352
00:20:59,832 --> 00:21:01,699
hungerik un shleferik

353
00:21:02,397 --> 00:21:04,382
naket un borves

354
00:21:06,008 --> 00:21:09,731
un zenen mir ongekumen keyn Sekuren

355
00:21:09,805 --> 00:21:11,588
dort vu mir ze'mir geboyrn gevorn.

356
00:21:13,467 --> 00:21:17,393
fun Sekuren hot men undz getribn vayter

357
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:20,211
dakht zikh Yedinits

358
00:21:20,487 --> 00:21:21,999
oykh a shtetl.

359
00:21:22,883 --> 00:21:25,357
fun Yedinits hot men undz getribn

360
00:21:25,448 --> 00:21:27,281
vider keyn Sekuren

361
00:21:27,608 --> 00:21:30,994
un dortn hot men shoyn geshaft a, a geto.

362
00:21:31,084 --> 00:21:33,626
vos hot ir getun oyf dem veg?

363
00:21:34,138 --> 00:21:35,634
me fleg geyn

364
00:21:36,012 --> 00:21:37,390
un faln

365
00:21:37,598 --> 00:21:41,861
un me fleg shlogn un hargenen. ikh gedenk mayn tatn hot men geshlogn ibern kop

366
00:21:44,314 --> 00:21:48,543
un er hot gefregt dem rumenishn soldat "far vos shlogstu mikh?

367
00:21:48,617 --> 00:21:50,433
vos hob ikh dir getun?

368
00:21:50,490 --> 00:21:51,896
vos hostu tsu mir?"

369
00:21:51,896 --> 00:21:53,403
hot er vider geshlogn.

370
00:21:53,494 --> 00:21:55,718
m'iz gegangen mit di bayonetn.

371
00:21:55,718 --> 00:21:59,664
zey zenen gega- di mentshn hobn zey geshlept in mitn di gasn

372
00:21:59,687 --> 00:22:03,393
b- ful mit, mit, mit shmuts, mit porekh.

373
00:22:03,484 --> 00:22:05,945
un in di beyde zaytn zenen gegangen

374
00:22:05,945 --> 00:22:11,156
politsey di, di ukraynishe. zenen gegangen d- di rumenishe soldatn

375
00:22:11,449 --> 00:22:16,995
un abi m'hot gezen a mentsh, az er, az er sho- shoklt zikh, hot men geharget.

376
00:22:17,220 --> 00:22:20,285
un s'iz b- g- vu du bist gegangen, zenen gelign

377
00:22:20,578 --> 00:22:22,242
UNK, skeletn.

378
00:22:23,143 --> 00:22:24,757
kinder

379
00:22:24,763 --> 00:22:26,815
ver hot gekent geyn azoy lang?

380
00:22:26,856 --> 00:22:32,632
ikh gedenk vi mayn mame hot, m- epes hob ikh getrogn oyf di pleytse, epes a, a tepl tsi epes, ikh veys nisht vos

381
00:22:32,632 --> 00:22:35,045
hot zi es tsugenumen tsu mir un hot gezogt

382
00:22:35,045 --> 00:22:36,451
"du kenst nisht blaybn do.

383
00:22:36,964 --> 00:22:39,897
du muzst geyn mit undz. bist dokh undzer kind

384
00:22:39,897 --> 00:22:42,341
az d'vest do blaybn, vet men dir dokh shisn"

385
00:22:42,482 --> 00:22:45,193
un azoy hot men gedarft shlepn zikh un geyn.

386
00:22:47,545 --> 00:22:52,030
ir gedenkt vi lang dos hot genumen fun Khotin tsu Sekuren?

387
00:22:50,245 --> 00:22:52,132
dos iz geven lang.

388
00:22:52,132 --> 00:22:54,772
dos iz geven kimat a MONTH.

389
00:22:54,772 --> 00:22:55,723
a monat.

390
00:22:56,168 --> 00:22:58,828
iz men gegang- un m'hot getribn bay nakht

391
00:22:56,419 --> 00:22:58,229
vos hot ir gehat tsu esn?

392
00:22:59,509 --> 00:23:02,745
bay nakht, ikh gedenk, ⟨ven⟩ a nakht

393
00:23:02,745 --> 00:23:06,860
iz mayn mame gelign oyf mir, mikh ibergedekt

394
00:23:07,457 --> 00:23:08,733
mit

395
00:23:08,773 --> 00:23:11,382
shmates epes mit, mit zek

396
00:23:11,710 --> 00:23:16,614
vayl bay nakht ⟨vi⟩ me fleg oyf di felder un oyf di velder un oyf di grozn

397
00:23:19,658 --> 00:23:21,441
me fleg esn groz.

398
00:23:24,214 --> 00:23:25,305
I'M SORRY

399
00:23:25,783 --> 00:23:27,177
iz

400
00:23:27,555 --> 00:23:29,325
iz zi gelign oyf mir

401
00:23:29,325 --> 00:23:33,715
un hot mikh ibergedekt, vayl di rumenishe soldatn mit di politseyen flegn umgeyn mit

402
00:23:33,715 --> 00:23:34,775
mit likhtlekh

403
00:23:34,775 --> 00:23:36,442
un zukhn yidishe meydlekh.

404
00:23:37,782 --> 00:23:45,022
ikh vel tomed gedenken vi azoy me fleg shrayen "mame, mame vu bistu? rateve mikh. mame, vu bistu?

405
00:23:45,022 --> 00:23:47,042
vos hostu mikh ibergelozt?"

406
00:23:50,286 --> 00:23:52,220
dos iz geven di gantse tsayt.

407
00:23:52,648 --> 00:23:55,612
dos iz geven di gan- ale, di gantse tsayt.

408
00:24:00,512 --> 00:24:02,885
iz zenen mir ongekumen keyn Sekuren.

409
00:24:03,685 --> 00:24:06,801
dortn iz geven geshafn a geto

410
00:24:08,798 --> 00:24:14,583
a por gasn vu di yidn z- hobn gevoynt un vos m'hot zey shoyn, zenen shoyn nisht geven

411
00:24:14,583 --> 00:24:17,215
un s'iz geven a dorf

412
00:24:17,215 --> 00:24:18,630
KOBOLCHYN

413
00:24:19,092 --> 00:24:24,604
di goyim hobn gelebt fun d- vos di yidn hobn zey gegebn broyt fun Sekuren

414
00:24:24,762 --> 00:24:27,658
un dernokh zenen zey gekumen mit di hek

415
00:24:28,677 --> 00:24:32,653
un mit shteyner, un m'hot oysgeharget ale yidn fun Sekuren

416
00:24:33,267 --> 00:24:35,488
tserabevet un oysgeharget

417
00:24:35,848 --> 00:24:41,776
di shtiber vos zenen geblibn fun di yidn, hot men epes a tsvey dray gasn hot men zey arumgeringlt

418
00:24:41,776 --> 00:24:44,246
mit shtekhndike drot

419
00:24:44,725 --> 00:24:47,638
un m'hot undz arayngetribn in di hayzer

420
00:24:48,066 --> 00:24:51,215
un m'hot undz gelozt shtarbn fun, fun

421
00:24:51,222 --> 00:24:55,090
s'hot undz oyfgeesn, di layz hobn undz oyfgegesn. di shmuts hot

422
00:24:58,883 --> 00:25:03,689
davke undzer FAMILY iz di goyim vos zey hobn zikh dervust az

423
00:25:03,689 --> 00:25:05,621
mir ze'mir ge- dortn

424
00:25:05,621 --> 00:25:10,875
flegn zey undz bay nakht a mol arayntrogn epes a shtikl mamelige tsi a shtikl

425
00:25:14,138 --> 00:25:18,294
dort zenen mir geven epes a, a monat

426
00:25:18,294 --> 00:25:21,070
a monat tsvey. s'iz shoyn geven kalt. s'iz shoyn gevorn

427
00:25:21,070 --> 00:25:22,029
vinter.

428
00:25:22,086 --> 00:25:23,964
dos iz geven

429
00:25:23,964 --> 00:25:25,184
eyn un fertsik.

430
00:25:26,035 --> 00:25:28,010
vos hot ir gehat tsu esn?

431
00:25:27,913 --> 00:25:32,123
m'hot nisht gegesn. me fleg geyn zukhn

432
00:25:32,123 --> 00:25:35,431
in, in reyen. bay nakht fleg men zikh aroysganvenen

433
00:25:35,431 --> 00:25:37,700
un m'hot geesn gro- vos hot men gegesn.

434
00:25:37,700 --> 00:25:43,666
m'hot geesn groz. mayn tate fleg tsunoyfnemen groz, un oyf der zun fleg er zey

435
00:25:43,666 --> 00:25:45,356
oystrikenen

436
00:25:45,356 --> 00:25:48,466
un undz makhn fun, ikh veys nisht vu er fleg nemen

437
00:25:48,466 --> 00:25:50,216
fun gazetn

438
00:25:50,216 --> 00:25:52,496
un undz kinder gibn reykhern

439
00:25:52,580 --> 00:25:54,086
mir zoln reykhern

440
00:25:54,086 --> 00:25:58,007
a sigaret, az es zol veyniker do dir veln esn.

441
00:26:04,476 --> 00:26:08,081
in ende eyn un fertsik

442
00:26:10,467 --> 00:26:13,093
hot men undz ongehoybn vider tsu traybn.

443
00:26:13,352 --> 00:26:14,713
shoyn geven kalt

444
00:26:15,310 --> 00:26:19,020
vider zenen gan di kolones, vifl s'iz geblibn. s'iz

445
00:26:19,020 --> 00:26:21,750
vos ile mol iz geven vos veyniker un veyniker.

446
00:26:22,380 --> 00:26:24,939
keyn kleyne kinder zenen shoyn nisht geven.

447
00:26:28,557 --> 00:26:33,827
vider di kolonen hot men undz getribn. ikh gedenk az s'iz gekumen epes

448
00:26:34,848 --> 00:26:37,139
s'iz geven a

449
00:26:37,315 --> 00:26:40,675
di CUZISTN zenen geven di bakhurim vos zey hobn gelernt

450
00:26:40,675 --> 00:26:43,115
mit mayn shvester in dem COLLEGE

451
00:26:43,115 --> 00:26:45,403
zenen gevorn ale

452
00:26:45,403 --> 00:26:46,893
politseyen.

453
00:26:47,338 --> 00:26:52,192
un v- zey hobn gevust az me shikt undz aroys, hobn zey undz epes gebrakht

454
00:26:53,177 --> 00:26:56,613
⟨getrukn⟩ epes shvarts broyt tsi mamelige

455
00:26:56,856 --> 00:27:03,181
un, un hobn undz ibergelozt az mir zoln mir esn, vayl m- zey hobn gevust az me shikt undz in Ukrayne.

456
00:27:04,838 --> 00:27:08,392
ikh veys take nisht azoy m'hot ge- ikh v- ikh veys nisht azoy m'hot gelebt.

457
00:27:09,327 --> 00:27:14,647
gekumen zenen mir tsu fus keyn Ataki.

458
00:27:14,647 --> 00:27:17,167
dos iz geven der Dnyester.

459
00:27:17,882 --> 00:27:22,095
dos iz geven di grenets tsvishn Besarabye mit Ukrayne.

460
00:27:25,223 --> 00:27:27,810
ile nekht hot men, hot men

461
00:27:27,810 --> 00:27:29,806
gevaldikt di yidishe kinder

462
00:27:30,437 --> 00:27:32,928
un s'iz shoyn nisht geven vos tsu rabeven

463
00:27:33,272 --> 00:27:38,463
un m- zey flegn zukhn, umgeyn un zukhn, di, di, di politsey un di soldatn di rumenishe

464
00:27:39,229 --> 00:27:43,880
un in der fri, dos iz shoyn geven in Ataki

465
00:27:45,085 --> 00:27:49,416
oyf ofene barzhes, azoy me firt kien un ferd

466
00:27:49,641 --> 00:27:51,373
hot men undz

467
00:27:53,067 --> 00:27:55,963
koytik un naket un borves

468
00:27:56,087 --> 00:27:57,549
un

469
00:27:57,589 --> 00:28:00,789
s'iz shoyn nisht geven keyn mentshn. s'iz shoyn geven khayes.

470
00:28:04,862 --> 00:28:08,551
hot men undz ibergefirt keyn MOGILEV PODOLSK.

471
00:28:09,655 --> 00:28:12,180
dos iz shoyn geven Ukrayne

472
00:28:13,333 --> 00:28:15,655
dos iz shoyn geven der Dnyester

473
00:28:15,932 --> 00:28:18,645
un dos iz shoyn geven dos shtikl erd

474
00:28:18,645 --> 00:28:20,071
vos

475
00:28:20,071 --> 00:28:22,906
vos di daytshn hobn gegibn di rumener

476
00:28:22,906 --> 00:28:26,416
als a COMPENSATION far dem vos zey zenen

477
00:28:26,416 --> 00:28:28,568
mit zey tsuzamen in der milkhome.

